67
00:06:40,533 --> 00:06:42,167
No way...

68
00:06:50,667 --> 00:06:54,200
Nice to see you again, Kingfisher.

69
00:06:55,233 --> 00:06:59,872
- Please take good care of my kid.
- Walk, please.

70
00:06:59,872 --> 00:07:02,700
