- Yeah.

71
00:07:03,433 --> 00:07:05,033
- I know a good cafe...
- Oh, it's Yul!

72
00:07:05,033 --> 00:07:07,000
Are you happy I'm taking you today?

73
00:07:07,000 --> 00:07:08,267
Yeah, I like it!

74
00:07:08,267 --> 00:07:09,400
Then I should come more often.

75
00:07:09,400 --> 00:07:11,776
Yeah, come every single day!

76
00:07:11,776 --> 00:07:13,316
Hello!

77
00:07:14,000 --> 00:07:17,067
- Good morning, Miss.
- Good morning.

78
00:07:17,067 --> 00:07:21,088
Good morning, Miss.
I'm Kwon Tae Seong, Yul's dad.

79
00:07:21,088 --> 00:07:23,300
- It's nice to meet you.
- Oh, hello.

80
00:07:23,300 --> 00:07:26,000
- Please take good care of Yul today.
- He says he's Yul's dad.

81
00:07:27,433 --> 00:07:30,700
Have fun today, Yul. See you tonight.

82
00:07:30,700 --> 00:07:32,333
You should do that with me.

83
00:07:32,333 --> 00:07:34,067
Do what?

84
00:07:34,067 --> 00:07:36,633
Oh, this is something Yul's mom
used to do for her every day.

85
00:07:36,633 --> 00:07:38,133
Let me show you.

86
00:07:38,133 --> 00:07:43,600
She goes, "My Yul, today, too,
with friends, get along well!"

87
00:07:43,600 --> 00:07:45,408
My Yul, today, too,

88
00:07:45,408 --> 00:07:47,520
- with friends, get along well!
- With friends, get along well!

89
00:07:47,520 --> 00:07:48,533
Say goodbye to your dad.

90
00:07:48,533 --> 00:07:51,133
- Bye-bye!
- Let's go inside, Yul. Be careful!

91
00:07:51,133 --> 00:07:52,500
Careful. Take it slow.

92
00:07:52,500 --> 00:07:54,333
Have a good day.

93
00:08:00,067 --> 00:08:03,767
So she had her husband's help.
That explains it.

94
00:08:03,767 --> 00:08:05,133
He's handsome.

95
00:08:05,133 --> 00:08:07,467
Yul's mom really has it all.

96
00:08:29,667 --> 00:08:33,600
Good morning! You're here again today.

97
00:08:38,433 --> 00:08:39,967
Good morning.

98
00:08:41,733 --> 00:08:44,067
