99
00:08:46,833 --> 00:08:48,900
Wow, Mr. Han!

100
00:08:49,632 --> 00:08:51,467
Oh, I didn't realize you were here.

101
00:08:51,467 --> 00:08:54,733
What a pleasant surprise
