102
00:08:54,733 --> 00:08:57,733
You're so pathetic
first thing in the morning.

103
00:08:57,733 --> 00:09:01,800
What is it this time? Lettuce?
Two bags of it?

104
00:09:03,700 --> 00:09:09,667
Oh, by the way, I heard that
Team 2 topped fan sales again.

105
00:09:09,667 --> 00:09:11,033
Congrats!

106
00:09:11,033 --> 00:09:13,333
You don't have to congratulate us
for doing what we always do.

107
00:09:13,333 --> 00:09:15,733
- Yeah, I know.
- I'm tired of hearing it.

108
00:09:15,733 --> 00:09:18,100
We also took first in dehumidifiers
and air purifiers.

109
00:09:20,533 --> 00:09:22,100
What about Team 3?

110
00:09:22,100 --> 00:09:27,600
