118
00:09:56,100 --> 00:09:57,300
Good morning!

119
00:09:57,300 --> 00:09:58,833
Come on in.

120
00:10:00,033 --> 00:10:02,000
Oh, my, hang on a second.

121
00:10:02,867 --> 00:10:04,333
Good morning.

122
00:10:04,333 --> 00:10:06,067
Keep up the good work.

123
00:10:09,767 --> 00:10:11,400
Director Yoo!

124
00:10:18,067 --> 00:10:20,133
Team Leader Han, have you been well?

125
00:10:20,133 --> 00:10:21,504
Oh, yeah, Director Yoo.

126
00:10:21,504 --> 00:10:23,200
- I heard you're back.
- Yeah.

127
00:10:23,200 --> 00:10:24,567
Enjoy your break?

128
00:10:24,567 --> 00:10:26,633
Break, my foot.

129
00:10:26,633 --> 00:10:28,800
Well, yeah.

130
00:10:28,800 --> 00:10:32,100
Others take a year or two off,
but you took a whole three years.

131
00:10:32,100 --> 00:10:35,433
Now that you're back,
you'd better make up for lost time.

132
00:10:35,433 --> 00:10:40,200
You're the ace of that team.
Time to make up for what you missed.

133
00:10:40,200 --> 00:10:41,867
