- What's this?

170
00:12:42,600 --> 00:12:43,800
What on earth is this?

171
00:12:43,800 --> 00:12:46,667
Do you really think
this was just an accident?

172
00:12:46,667 --> 00:12:49,467
Or is it more likely someone killed him
and staged it as an accident?

173
00:12:49,467 --> 00:12:53,867
Hey, you went after the drug kingpin
yourself all the way there?

174
00:12:53,867 --> 00:12:57,200
You're insane. You still haven't
come to your senses.

175
00:12:57,200 --> 00:12:59,667
You did the same thing years ago, remember?
You almost got yourself killed.

176
00:12:59,667 --> 00:13:01,733
That... What was it? Kingfisher.

177
00:13:01,733 --> 00:13:05,800
You almost got killed
by Kingfisher's bullet. Ah, really.

178
00:13:07,640 --> 00:13:08,640
- Breaking news.
- What is it?

179
00:13:08,640 --> 00:13:11,533
- A shooting using a sniper rifle
- What's that?

180
00:13:11,533 --> 00:13:13,700
has occurred in the heart of Seoul.

181
00:13:13,700 --> 00:13:16,400
- Some speculate that Kingfisher,
- Speak of the devil, is that it?

182
00:13:16,400 --> 00:13:20,767
the infamous serial gun killer
who disappeared for the past four years,

183
00:13:20,767 --> 00:13:23,000
- may have returned.
