The incident took place at a hotel
in Jeonjak-dong, Seoul.

185
00:13:26,433 --> 00:13:27,667
[Breaking News: Kingfisher Returns?]
A man in his thirties,

186
00:13:27,667 --> 00:13:28,667
[Shooting Homicide in Seoul]
identified as Mr. Hwang,

187
00:13:28,667 --> 00:13:33,267
