190
00:13:41,500 --> 00:13:44,467
The incident took place at a hotel
in Jeonjak-dong, Seoul.

191
00:13:44,467 --> 00:13:47,000
A man in his thirties,
identified as Mr. Hwang,

192
00:13:47,000 --> 00:13:50,833
was struck and killed by a bullet
fired from outside the building.

193
00:13:50,833 --> 00:13:52,900
[Jeonjak-dong Hotel]
Considering the use of a sniper rifle

194
00:13:52,900 --> 00:13:54,528
[Kingfisher Sniper Incident]
and the victim's criminal history,

195
00:13:54,528 --> 00:13:56,700
police see this as the first such case

196
00:13:56,700 --> 00:13:58,533
since the Haegong-dong
boarding house case four years ago...

197
00:13:58,533 --> 00:13:59,833
Mom, thanks for the meal.

198
00:13:59,833 --> 00:14:02,200
Okay, hurry along.

199
00:14:02,200 --> 00:14:03,296
Some speculate that Kingfisher,

200
00:14:03,296 --> 00:14:04,800
- the infamous serial gun killer...
- Sun Il, look at that.

201
00:14:04,800 --> 00:14:07,333
They are keeping a close eye
on the situation.

202
00:14:07,333 --> 00:14:09,233
Tae Seong is going to be busy again.

203
00:14:09,233 --> 00:14:12,500
Kingfisher is the nickname
for a professional sniper killer

204
00:14:12,500 --> 00:14:14,496
who has killed 93 people to date,

205
00:14:14,496 --> 00:14:16,900
starting with the 2010 Semyung-dong shooting.

206
00:14:16,900 --> 00:14:18,464
- Despite committing serious crimes,
- Kwon Tae Seong!

207
00:14:18,464 --> 00:14:19,464
criminals just received light sentences
- and were released.
- Come in here.

208
00:14:20,464 --> 00:14:22,112
The killings are characterized

209
00:14:22,112 --> 00:14:25,033
by targeting criminals
with high recidivism rates.

210
00:14:25,033 --> 00:14:27,712
If this incident is confirmed
to be the work of Kingfisher,

211
00:14:27,712 --> 00:14:30,112
it would mean that the infamous serial killer

212
00:14:30,112 --> 00:14:33,467
who once shook the nation
has returned after four years,

213
00:14:33,467 --> 00:14:37,767
causing another major shock
and public concern.

214
00:14:37,767 --> 00:14:42,100
Why would you hand that
over to someone else? Why?

215
00:14:42,100 --> 00:14:45,267
